iframe.description:
Set to true to enable iframe mode. When enabled, the checkout URL can be embedded in an iframe on your website. Payment results will be sent via postMessage to the parent window instead of redirecting.

**Important:** This field is NOT included in the signature calculation.

**Iframe Integration Example:**
```html
<iframe id="paylink-checkout"
    src="{checkout_url}"
    style="width: 100%; height: 600px; border: none;"
    allow="payment"></iframe>

<script>
window.addEventListener('message', function(event) {
    if (event.data && event.data.type === 'paylink_payment') {
        console.log('Payment result:', event.data);
        // event.data.success - boolean
        // event.data.invoice_id - integer
        // event.data.invoice_status - 'PAID' or 'UNPAID'
        // event.data.message - string
    }
});
</script>
```

